# XML (D105)
doc is xml with root "library"
lib is root of doc
add element "book" to lib and call it book
set attribute "id" of book to "1"
add element "title" with text "Otter" to book
say pretty text from xml doc
say text of "title" in book
say attribute "id" of book
if book has attribute "id"
    say "has id"
.
if element "book" exists in lib
    say "book exists"
.
books is elements "book" in lib
say length of books
first is child 0 in lib
say name of first
all is children 0 in lib
say length of all
e is element "title" in book
set text of e to "Renamed"
set text of "title" in book to "Again"
say attributes of book
remove attribute "id" from book
write xml doc to file "lib.xml"
again is xml from file "lib.xml"
say text from xml again
parsed is xml from text "<a><b/></a>"
remove element element "b" in parsed
say text from xml parsed
